#reason docs/updates.md Says how updates work, when Lantern never restarts by itself and what each check sends, as the privacy note requires.
#reason src/main/updater/controller.ts Runs the menu check with its result dialog and answers the window's notice and button requests, accepting only known actions.
#reason src/main/updater/dialogs.ts Words every result of a manual check and the restart confirmation that names exactly what would be ended.
#reason src/main/updater/feed.ts Reads the update service's 204, 200 and 404 and GitHub's latest release with no token, a timeout and a fixed release host.
#reason src/main/updater/guard.ts Holds canInstallNow so one pure function decides whether a restart may happen, counting only what a restart ends and failing closed when unknown.
#reason src/main/updater/native.ts Keeps Electron's Squirrel updater behind a small interface so the service can be tested with a stub.
#reason src/main/updater/process-activity.ts Finds the terminals and running commands below Lantern, the only work a restart ends and the guard can tie to it.
#reason src/main/updater/service.ts Schedules checks, downloads on a Mac and installs only when the guard allows, never on its own while it is false or after Not now.
#reason src/main/updater/version.ts Compares versions without a dependency, pre-releases included, so a release is offered only when strictly newer.
#reason src/renderer/features/update-notice.ts Draws the update card the main process pushes and sends the pressed button back.
#reason src/renderer/lib/update-notice-view.ts Keeps the notice wording and button actions in one pure place that a test can read.
#reason src/shared/session-liveness.ts Gives one definition of a live session, counting unknown as alive, for the idle tabs.
#reason src/shared/settings-updates.ts Declares Check for updates automatically, on by default, which stops every update request when off.
#reason src/shared/updates.ts Defines the notice shape, channels and the four button actions shared by main, preload and window.
#reason test/helpers/updater-world.ts Builds the updater with a stub network, native updater, timers and activity so each case reads in a few lines.
#reason test/update-notice.test.ts Proves the card shows the waiting message and sends the pressed action.
#reason test/updater-feed.test.ts Proves 204 is up to date, 200 an update, 404 an unavailable feed, failures are failures and no token is sent.
#reason test/updater-guard.test.ts Proves canInstallNow is false for a run, a terminal or a process and true for watched sessions in other terminals.
#reason test/updater-service.test.ts Proves a 200 schedules a download, the guard never restarts while false, the off switch makes no request and failures are logged only.
#reason test/updater-surface.test.ts Proves the menu item, result texts, restart confirmation, update IPC and the setting default.
#reason test/updater-version.test.ts Proves version ordering, including pre-releases and numeric comparison.
#reason docs/index.md Links the new Updates page so people find what the checks send and how to turn them off.
#reason src/main/app-menu.ts Adds Check for Updates… to the app menu on every platform, only when a handler is given so existing menus are unchanged.
#reason src/main/main.ts Wires the updater with the setting, the real network, the run and process guard inputs and the dialogs, and starts and stops it with the app.
#reason src/preload/workspace.ts Exposes the notice, its button actions and the notice push to the window without exposing ipcRenderer.
#reason src/renderer/global.d.ts Types the three new bridge calls so the window code stays checked.
#reason src/renderer/lib/idle-tabs.ts Takes the live-session rule from the shared module so tabs and the updater cannot disagree.
#reason src/renderer/workspace.css Styles the bottom-left update card so it does not cover the crash notice.
#reason src/renderer/workspace.html Adds the hidden update card with its two buttons, named so the page keeps its accessibility check.
#reason src/renderer/workspace.ts Starts the update notice when the workspace opens.
#reason src/shared/lang/en/messages.json Adds the update notice, confirmation and result texts to the one message catalogue.
#reason src/shared/settings-registry.ts Registers the Updates category so the setting appears in Settings and the settings file.
#reason test/idle-tabs-workspace.test.ts Stubs the new update bridge calls the workspace now makes on start.
#reason test/project-window.test.ts Stubs the new update bridge calls the workspace now makes on start.
#reason test/settings-editor.test.ts Counts the Updates setting among the settings now listed.
#reason test/sidebar.test.ts Stubs the new update bridge calls the workspace now makes on start.
